      "kind": "heading",
      "start_line": 10,
      "end_line": 10,
      "raw": "## Figma 매핑\n",
      "level": 2,
      "title": "Figma 매핑"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000011",
      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 11,
      "end_line": 17,
      "raw": "- 프레임: `258:7963` `ViewOptionBar`\n- 버튼 순서:\n  - `258:7964` `ReadOnlyToggle` -> `readerMode`\n  - `258:8048` `WarpText` -> `textAutoGenerate`\n  - `258:8039` `CenterView` -> `recursiveMethod`\n  - `258:7965` `TextToSpeech` -> `textToSpeech`\n  - `258:7966` `PaperOption` -> `fileFormat`\n",
      "items": [
